  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.4: Follow-up to the v1.0.3 Avalonia table-column work. v1.0.3 weighted star columns by per-column natural content length so wide tables fit their viewport; in tables with one cell of long prose that cell's column took ~half the viewport and the other columns collapsed to one letter per line (#26). Each column's star weight is now capped at 3× the median, taming the outlier without affecting tables where columns are similarly sized. The weight computation moved into `AdocNet.Layout.TableColumnWeights` for direct unit-testing. See CHANGELOG.md.",
